 "text": "services\npartners\ncases\ncreator series\nbook a free discovery meeting\nEN\nDA\nEmma Bauditz\nFounder Branding & Digital Strategy\n\nhelping founders, startups and growing brands become clearer, more visible, and easier to trust online.\n\nbook a free discovery meeting\nview services\nAVAILABLE\nbooking now\nTop 1%\nLinkedIn worldwide\n#2\nPersonal Branding & Thought Leadership · LinkedIn · Denmark\n\ntrusted by 50+ founders, creators and startups worldwide\n\nmade in collaboration with WK Conversions\n\nABOUT\na founder who gets founders.\n\ni help founders and growing brands show up online with clarity and confidence. through founder branding, ghostwriting, ambassador content, and business social media management, including captions and copywriting, i make sure your brand sounds like you, only sharper. every piece of work is built to strengthen trust, deepen visibility, and turn your audience into believers.\n\nstrategy first\n\nevery post, profile, and campaign starts with a clear positioning and goal, not guesswork.\n\nfounder and brand experience\n\ni've built personal brands and company brands from zero, so i understand both sides.\n\ncontent built for trust\n\ntone-matched writing that sounds like you, designed to convert quietly over time.\n\nsimple, professional process\n\nclear deliverables, predictable timelines, and no agency fluff.\n\nSOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING AWARDS\n2026 finalist\n\nfinalist in the social media marketer category at the socialday social media marketing awards 2026.\n\nSERVICES\nbuild a personal brand people remember.\n\nmost of my work happens through ongoing partnerships with founders and startups. if you are not ready for that, you can start with a one-time audit.\n\nfounder linkedin playbook\nFREE\n\nthe practical guide I would use to build a personal brand from zero.\n\ngeneral guide\nnot personalized\nget the free playbook ↗\npremium linkedin audit\n€149\n\na complete linkedin and personal brand review with strategy, content direction and examples.\n\ncomplete linkedin profile audit\npersonal brand positioning\nrewritten profile recommendations\nbanner and featured visual direction\ncontent pillars and post ideas\nposting and engagement strategy\npersonalized action plan\n\ndelivered digitally within 7 working days after receiving the questionnaire.\n\nbuild my personal brand\n\nsecure payment via stripe. receipt sent by email, then you'll be asked to complete a short questionnaire.\n\nBEFORE\nAFTER\nBEFORE\nAFTER\nlooking for a long-term brand partner?\n\nongoing founder branding, startup strategy and brand collaborations are the core of what I do. every partnership is shaped around your voice, goals and growth stage.\n\nFOUNDER BRANDING\nfrom €500\n\nongoing personal branding support built around you, your goals and your voice.\n\nCAN INCLUDE:\n\nlinkedin ghostwriting\nmonthly profile updates and optimization\nbuilding your linkedin presence from scratch\npersonal brand and content strategy\nlinkedin setup for founders and small teams\ntrusted by founders\nSTARTUP BRAND AND MARKETING STRATEGY\nfrom €1000\n\nflexible brand and marketing support for startups that need an extra pair of hands or ongoing strategic support.\n\nCAN INCLUDE:\n\nsocial media management\nbrand and marketing strategy\nongoing brand support\ncontent strategy and creation\nsetting up and optimizing company profiles\nfounder and company positioning\ntrusted by startups\nBRAND PARTNERSHIPS\n\ncollaborations with brands that fit my audience, work and content.\n\nCAN INCLUDE:\n\nsponsored linkedin content\nbrand collaborations and campaigns\nambassador partnerships\naffiliate partnerships\nlong term creator partnerships\nspeaking opportunities and events\ntrusted by brands\nbook a free discovery call\n\nno commitment. let's see if we are a fit.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\na simple, honest process.\n01\nbook a call or pick a service\n\nwe start with a free discovery call, or you order a service directly if the scope is clear.\n\n02\ndefine goals and direction\n\nwe get clear on your goals, audience, positioning, voice, scope and what success should look like.\n\n03\ncreate and approve\n\ni build the strategy, profile, content, campaign or creative work, with room for feedback and approval along the way.\n\n04\nlaunch and optimise\n\nwe publish, track what works, and keep refining so visibility and trust grow over time.\n\nCASES\nbrands i've built with.\n\na few brands i've helped build, launch, and grow. click a logo to explore the full case.\n\n35,000+ combined followers\n€2M valuation phase supported\n2,800+ linkedin followers grown\n#19 on Product Hunt\nbrand built from zero\ncreated mascot Kibi\nsocial presence built from the ground up\nfirst 200 followers in the first few months on Instagram\n+1,335% instagram profile visits in the first month\n+1,072% linkedin reach in the first month\n2.6x linkedin followers in just 30 days\nexplore all cases\nWHAT CLIENTS SAY\n\"emma was a key part of setting up our business and brand from the ground up. she is incredibly detail oriented, ensuring every element of our visual identity and communication was consistent...\"\nSee more\nRobin Bos\nFounder & CSO · K.B Consultancy\n\"emma did an excellent job managing the social media and product launch for hirebetter.io. she handled four platforms, facebook, linkedin, tiktok, and instagram, with a sharp, data-driven app...\"\nSee more\nTom van Greevenbroek\nFounder & CTO · hirebetter.io\n\"so thankful to have had emma as a social media manager at get tasked. she has a natural talent for creating engaging content, understanding audiences, and building a strong brand presence. e...\"\nSee more\nApril Wilhelm\nFounder · Get Tasked\n\"emma and bFound. has been a game-changer for tale forge's brand presence. from delivering sharp linkedin audits for our company page and founder profiles to setting up our content calendar,...\"\nSee more\nKevin El-zarka\nFounder & CTO · Tale Forge\n\"emma helped me improve my linkedin profile in an incredibly practical and thoughtful way. she spotted details and opportunities that i had either missed or didn't even know existed, and gave...\"\nSee more\nEmma Ivarsson\nFounder · Scen "
